<title>USA: Video Lottery names Richard Haddrill CEO.</title>
<headline>Video Lottery names Richard Haddrill CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Lottery Technologies Inc said Tuesday its president Richard Haddrill has assumed the additional title and responsibility of chief executive officer.  </p>
<p>The position had been vacant.</p>
<p>The company has not had a permanent CEO since J. Stephen Vanderwoude left in 1995.</p>
